---@class aws.transcribe.UpdateLanguageModelRequest
---@field ModelName aws.transcribe.ModelName The name of the custom language model you want to update. Model names are case sensitive.
---@field DataAccessRoleArn? aws.transcribe.DataAccessRoleArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of an IAM role. If you include EncryptionConfiguration in your request, this role must have permissions to access the specified KMS key. If the role that you specify doesn't have the appropriate permissions, your request fails.
---@field EncryptionConfiguration? aws.transcribe.EncryptionConfiguration Specifies the new encryption configuration for your custom language model. The model artifacts are re-encrypted in place using the specified KMS key or with an AWS-owned key if a key is not supplied.

